            "properties": {
              "Node name for S&R": "Note"
            },
            "widgets_values": [
              "## motion/silent/still-to-video-5s\n\nAfter Queue, click **Save video (MP4) \u2014 open node for preview** for an inline preview. File lands on the host at `${COMFY_OUTPUT_DIR}/ez_*_*.mp4` (container `/outputs`). Save frames PNG is secondary.\n\nWan 2.2 TI2V-5B Apache 2.0 silent I2V smoke (~5 s @ 24 fps).\nModels: wan2.2_ti2v_5B_fp16.safetensors + umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors (CLIP type wan) + wan2.2_vae.safetensors.\nWidgets: seed 42 fixed \u00b7 121 frames \u00b7 832x480 \u00b7 24 fps.\n\nLoadImage default example.png. After a still, set ez_still_draft_*.png or ez_still_hero_*.png.\nEdit Motion / prompt only. PRIMARY OUTPUT: VHS_VideoCombine MP4 24 fps.\n\nThis graph is a smoke/demo (121 frames). For 90s films or ez_shot_01..06 concat, use motion/silent/still-to-shot (120 frames + last frame).\nPrompt enhance is on by default (on-box Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507). After Queue, the Enhance node shows the prompt CLIP used (or a passthrough reason). Turn Enhance off to use the widget text as-is. Optional style dropdown.\n\nOccupancy: wan \u2014 stop LTX, podcast, music. One GB10 job.\n"
            ],
            "title": "Operator note"
          },
